2026-10-27T11:52:26.9443659Z       │           └── reqwest v0.12.28
2026-10-27T11:52:26.9444023Z       │               └── codex-lb-egress v0.1.0
2026-10-27T11:52:26.9444446Z       │                   └── codex-lb-egress-worker v0.1.0
2026-10-27T11:52:26.9444825Z       └── zstd v0.13.3
